<title>JAPAN: Kyocera - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kyocera - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		270.77		vs	  241.32</p>
<p> Operating	   43.58		vs	   35.53</p>
<p> Current	     50.49		vs	   48.05</p>
<p> Net		   24.87		vs	   35.33</p>
<p> EPS		  133.03 yen	  vs	  188.99 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    187 million	  vs	 187 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 30.00 yen	  vs	   25.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kyocera Corp is a top manufacturer of semiconductor components.</p>
